## Findings
- Dashboard Module Hub:
    - Cards now display ONLY the module code (e.g., BT1101), making them cleaner.
    - Card size has been increased, improving readability.
    - Quick Actions (New Task, New Note) are always available in the top right.
    - Footer Actions (Maximize, Tasks, Notes, Canvas) appear clearly on hover at the bottom of the card.
    - Quick Stats (count of tasks/notes) are clearly visible with icons.
    - User experience for interaction is significantly improved with larger, clear buttons on hover.
- Courses Page:
    - Module cards are detailed and include full names, credits, and exam dates, complementing the simplified view in the dashboard hub.
